ou-family:p022:m0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"聖上","kind":"person","person_id":"83d_b6e_058","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0250","start":250,"end":252,"surface":"元輔","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0287","start":287,"end":289,"surface":"皇駕","kind":"person","person_id":"83d_b6e_058","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"裴憲","kind":"person","person_id":"c6e_8f3_014","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0350","start":350,"end":352,"surface":"大駕","kind":"person","person_id":"83d_b6e_058","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0354","start":354,"end":356,"surface":"王浚","kind":"person","person_id":"9c1_ff0_1b5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"永嘉四年河朔上書中的王浚；與早年平吳舟師王濬不同敘事年代／職區，不按同字全篇合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0357","start":357,"end":359,"surface":"苟晞","kind":"person","person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0383","start":383,"end":385,"surface":"皇輿","kind":"person","person_id":"83d_b6e_058","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023","text":"越與苟晞不協，馥不先白於越，而直上書，越大怒。先是，越召馥及淮南太守裴碩，馥不肯行，而令碩率兵先進。碩貳於馥，乃舉兵稱馥擅命，已奉越密旨圖馥，遂襲之，為馥所敗。碩退保東城，求救於元帝。帝遣揚威將軍甘卓、建威將軍郭逸攻馥于壽春。安豐太守孫惠帥眾應之，使謝摛為檄。摛，馥之故將也。馥見檄，流涕曰：「必謝摛之辭。」摛聞之，遂毀草。旬日而馥眾潰，奔于項，為新蔡王確所拘，憂憤發病卒。","source_position":{"raw_start":4086,"raw_end":4275,"raw_text":"　　越與苟晞不協，馥不先白於越，而直上書，越大怒。先是，越召馥及淮南太守裴碩，馥不肯行，而令碩率兵先進。碩貳於馥，乃舉兵稱馥擅命，已奉越密旨圖馥，遂襲之，為馥所敗。碩退保東城，求救於元帝。帝遣揚威將軍甘卓、建威將軍郭逸攻馥于壽春。安豐太守孫惠帥眾應之，使謝摛為檄。摛，馥之故將也。馥見檄，流涕曰：「必謝摛之辭。」摛聞之，遂毀草。旬日而馥眾潰，奔于項，為新蔡王確所拘，憂憤發病卒。","display_wrapper_start":0,"display_wrapper_end":0,"raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-7903772-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"苟晞","kind":"person","person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"馥","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_BA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"076王廙元帝鎮江左、討周馥脈絡與本段相合；不是只從單字馥匹配韓馥。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"馥","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_BA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"076王廙元帝鎮江左、討周馥脈絡與本段相合；不是只從單字馥匹配韓馥。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"裴碩","kind":"person","person_id":"75m_x4w_c9x","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p023:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"馥